insert into backings (id, support_id, team_id, case_id, text, citation_ids, created_at, created_by, updated_at, kind) values
  ('430a514d-e0bf-4603-b0c8-611b0cd356d7', 'c90b7acd-9fa2-4a9e-a7cf-9f13c8983668', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 1), 'philosopher Robert Sparrow''s "Killer Robots" (2007) argues that just war requires someone who can be held responsible for each death. Our team put it simply: letting AI use weapons turns a moral decision into a program.', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333301', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'framework'),
  ('62b8a749-c8f6-4b1b-96d9-211deb7c921b', 'cb170cb3-80e8-4fe2-a231-505433dac4ac', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 1), 'the case warns that a human may remain in the loop but rely on the system, and that a well-timed suggestion can steer a decision. The wargame shows the models treated nuclear escalation as a manageable risk, which is exactly the kind of judgment we wouldn''t want people deferring to.', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333301', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'case_fact'),
  ('c170f297-7c31-42ec-bde7-fab400becc84', 'c74f74b5-ae6c-4869-919d-de3f5134870b', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 1), 'the team''s progression: hands, knife, bow, gun, drone, AI. The case notes drone warfare already distances a country from its soldiers'' danger, and that efficient, low-risk war may be easier to start and harder to restrain.', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333301', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'example'),
  ('8efd2734-45cf-4a67-b08f-67e99ca03db0', 'c8e824ca-cfb7-4d34-bc35-08f1e5dfe1a0', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 1), 'in 2018 Google employees protested the Pentagon''s Project Maven drone-imagery program, and Google declined to renew the contract. Conscientious refusal by builders has precedent.', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333301', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'example'),
  ('104be9c3-ea22-4867-ae87-850a625cd244', '2b42f81c-ee47-4288-b6ed-ac0344cb2d7a', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 1), 'U.S. Defense Department Directive 3000.09 already requires "appropriate levels of human judgment over the use of force" for autonomous weapons. Our position strengthens and enforces public rules like this rather than relying on vendor contracts.', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333301', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'case_fact'),
  ('d98acf13-7556-46d0-bd2a-33ba57926434', '6091c1be-9f2c-43b8-bd91-6592c3b61d72', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 1), 'this is a chilling-effect argument rooted in privacy and free-association values. A limit on domestic mass surveillance protects the democratic accountability that gives the military its authority.', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333301', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'framework'),
  ('e3f88806-aa58-4c75-b5ec-1a87a4f0a081', 'f173a0e4-0d0b-46a3-af33-47378d524e78', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 3), 'the case contrasts San Francisco with New Zealand on both points (NBC News, 2007).', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333302', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'case_fact'),
  ('89741611-8c24-4de4-9e52-9e2776923eb3', 'b4180bf8-9ffc-47c1-ad4c-bc5de0cee3ac', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 3), 'corrective justice says whoever is wronged is owed repair; philosopher Avishai Margalit''s *The Ethics of Memory* (2002) argues that communities have duties to remember grave wrongs. The case reports that survivors consider Japan''s apologies and reparations unsatisfactory.', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333302', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'framework'),
  ('dbacb1af-a4cb-49f7-bf90-bae8b45be272', 'cc83ce18-3f0b-4961-a055-16ff00c6cb21', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 3), 'in practice we put it this way: the goal is "not to shame a country, but to show what people are capable of."', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333302', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'source'),
  ('8f218b17-ae43-4057-a31d-b7e1498ca513', 'd415339b-79f1-4147-883d-132a5634c255', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 3), 'Kant''s universalizability test: act only on a rule everyone could follow. The case notes many U.S. statues honor conquistadors and Confederate leaders while few honor Native Americans or enslaved people.', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333302', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'framework'),
  ('7a4d40c9-5c41-48cc-af56-bb1c51389e5e', '578bf4c8-30f7-4eb3-8af8-c4736b3bd6c7', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 3), 'Germany''s public memory of the Holocaust, including Berlin''s Memorial to the Murdered Jews of Europe and preserved camps used as public history, which the case contrasts with U.S. plantations used as wedding venues. Our team flagged Germany as the model: acknowledgment, remediation, and no denial.', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333302', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'example'),
  ('82f90c0b-4da1-4447-aa2a-b69c1b95bbf2', '46d55722-da54-423c-9aa9-4c2e07cf32a8', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 3), 'New Zealand''s council rejected its statue for lack of local support, while San Francisco''s communities wanted theirs; the same test gives different answers. Serene Khader''s *Decolonizing Universalism* (in the team''s resources) argues we can hold universal values against injustice without imposing one culture''s way of expressing them.', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333302', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'framework'),
  ('87c1e974-a7d4-47a2-b6d6-abf1eee7ace4', '80b51817-2be7-4994-9bde-9162549cae9d', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 4), 'Kant''s principle that ought implies can. Our team raised illness and genetics in practice.', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333303', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'framework'),
  ('efd812a4-f562-48f0-841d-bbcfbf7d92dd', '528840d3-6476-4d2f-97ee-79291a4394dc', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 4), 'Heather Widdows shows people are praised or shamed by how they look, and the case notes beauty ideals link weight or untidiness to laziness. The research in the case shows looks shape earnings and even criminal judgments, which are outcomes people don''t deserve.', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333303', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'case_fact'),
  ('15df7605-0806-401f-aeea-a896eb788e9f', '22d882f5-5c06-42d5-a543-4cb7751940ba', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 4), 'knowing three languages helps a career, but no one has a moral duty to be trilingual. The case''s proponents show pursuing beauty is rational, not obligatory.', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333303', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'example'),
  ('2c4c190f-e90b-4564-8ccd-fb4bb8175186', '9b5f6adc-bfe7-4cb1-94c1-c03085d2a233', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 4), 'Kant''s respect for autonomy; the team''s working claim: "pursuing beauty is permissible on autonomy grounds."', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333303', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'framework'),
  ('890836b0-a75f-424f-bdf3-b6e3785c406b', '24b6b2a2-55ab-4369-8c0e-08d79907034f', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 4), 'soft paternalism allows protecting people whose choices aren''t fully informed or voluntary, such as minors. Our team raised minors using untested weight-loss drugs and influencers promoting unhealthy standards.', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333303', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'framework'),
  ('a97bf496-9e8d-4598-992e-e28b0b4823a1', 'ecf7a90f-765e-4415-a433-daa00054eef3', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 4), 'the team''s "Instagram face" point: aesthetics converge even without explicit promotion. Economists call this a positional good: its value depends on being ahead of others.', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333303', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'example'),
  ('0021808d-47a9-497e-93d0-d772806376c5', '830a7389-5426-480c-97e0-917bdbca2875', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 5), 'the soldier indicted for about $400,000 in trades on the Maduro operation, and the 150 accounts that bought the day before intervention in Iran.', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333304', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'case_fact'),
  ('5795f850-2952-48c6-9a2b-e9d77b429c36', '84c87654-fe66-45c7-8b07-2c75ed6f691c', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 5), 'Kant''s humanity formula; Michael Sandel''s *What Money Can''t Buy* (2012) argues that putting a price on some goods corrupts them, using "death pools" on celebrities as an example. Our team''s notes: markets strip context and treat people as means.', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333304', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'framework'),
  ('b67c1152-b05d-4715-af27-bf54788b4297', '24125672-f441-47f8-ab7f-a2ec60576872', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 5), 'the U.S. government canceled DARPA''s 2003 market on terrorism and coups after critics warned that people could profit from causing attacks.', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333304', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'example'),
  ('7cb3eaec-708d-4a85-a31b-d82bf8cb5503', '0932a786-eb7e-479d-a14d-da8283407d13', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 5), 'Kalshi''s 2024 election markets forecast well, showing the information came from public signals.', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333304', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'case_fact'),
  ('1168c791-853b-44d4-a39d-61a2df86ccdb', '7162ab84-828f-45f6-a2f5-aa8da4b8eb93', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 5), 'Mill''s harm principle: limit freedom only to prevent harm to others. A bet on an election mainly risks the bettor''s own money.', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333304', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'framework'),
  ('0121d75d-0a19-4ffc-8bc9-783230371bf4', '5a949b1e-1630-4a5a-87d4-7f0e171350e0', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 5), 'our notes compare this to warning labels on cigarettes and alcohol: allowed, but with friction, limits and clear information. Platforms can ban insiders from trading and add deposit limits.', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333304', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'example'),
  ('3248a24f-db70-4e0c-badd-54a10638faef', '8daae389-8048-4735-bf47-ad76fcb143fc', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 7), 'the social model of disability (Mike Oliver): the barrier, not the body, does the excluding. Elizabeth Anderson''s democratic equality (1999): equality means standing as an equal in civil society, and shops are where that standing is lived.', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333301', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'framework'),
  ('8cd098fa-fbde-4776-8b46-736918fb683b', '4c8f42bd-9bb7-4345-b8ff-0beb0b31996a', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 7), 'bounties are a normal tool: the federal False Claims Act pays whistleblowers, and California''s Prop 65 pays private enforcers. Condemning serial litigants while leaving public enforcement unfunded is incoherent.', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333301', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'example'),
  ('d90d1c85-0f2e-4898-9788-5db276af19ca', '7913f906-7c42-4153-832b-560b21092c5e', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 7), 'Hamraie and Fritsch, "Crip Technoscience Manifesto" (2019, shared by Dr. B). In March 1990 activists crawled up the U.S. Capitol steps, and Berkeley activists earlier chipped away curbs to make their own curb cuts. Read Bouyer charitably, as part of this tradition.', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333301', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'framework'),
  ('1924a128-f668-415c-9b48-d6b9c62a330c', 'd5b53dda-ee5e-4542-8370-8a81c6a35086', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 7), 'Goodhart''s law: when a measure becomes a target, it stops being a good measure. Steven Shavell (1984): after-the-fact lawsuits work badly when defendants are "judgment-proof" and the regulator knows the standards better than they do. Small, old businesses fail every test; chains and public agencies pass them.', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333301', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'framework'),
  ('478b5fd8-c332-43a3-a79b-b6c5ed03a03b', 'f9089a7f-9cf7-4174-b14d-f6f767b92f42', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 7), 'Lola''s was sued over outdoor tables; removing them helps no wheelchair user. The Richmond closure produced zero ramps. Derek Parfit''s "leveling down" objection: making some worse off without making anyone better off is no gain in equality.', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333301', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'framework'),
  ('c48373aa-6b94-467a-bcab-44ebca14653f', '1c1c2404-951f-4b79-953d-ccdceda99e91', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 7), 'Iris Marion Young''s social connection model: responsibility for structural injustice grows with power, privilege and ability to act. The Richmond landlord controlled the structure. Teammate framing: "same charge, different penalty," as in sentencing. StopGap makes cheap ramps, so many fixes are affordable.', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333301', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'framework'),
  ('e02149e9-632c-44a1-8061-a858567d41e8', 'fdfd5fb0-16e5-4bed-8479-af2324aea34f', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 9), 'Robert Nozick''s entitlement theory (1974), a pro-property theory, condemns this title: a handover from the army that took it to the army that took it from them. An Ottoman admiral''s signature isn''t Egyptian consent.', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333302', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'framework'),
  ('198e5c95-836c-4241-a9d8-722e74c21a39', '0aa7680f-bdd8-4f73-aea7-96ef28ee7d76', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 9), 'Kant''s test: if everyone kept what they took whenever they judged themselves better caretakers, ownership would belong to the strongest and best-funded, destroying the property claim the museum relies on. And "we know better how to care for your heritage" is paternalism that treats Egyptians as less than equal moral agents.', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333302', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'framework'),
  ('19092173-780c-4079-aaea-b7c86b5735de', '14a3109d-5609-4554-a7e2-b2924cb51ef2', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 9), 'Iris Marion Young''s parameters (power, privilege, interest, collective ability) put a heavy duty on a wealthy national institution. W.D. Ross lists reparation among our basic duties.', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333302', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'framework'),
  ('2251ebb2-6934-4041-aa0f-e961cde7371e', 'f6084f54-4eab-4556-a75e-833591cf253a', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 9), 'the universal-museum defenders (Appiah, Cuno) rest their case on care and access. With the GEM open, care is a tie, and a tie goes to where the object was made and is part of living identity. The 2002 "universal museum" declaration was signed by the directors of the museums holding contested objects: no one should judge their own case.', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333302', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'framework'),
  ('873f48e5-f3ae-4a5a-ae06-36cae8b30572', '278db685-eb6d-4db3-b49a-98310eca659d', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 9), 'the British Museum can already return human remains (Human Tissue Act 2004, s. 47) and Nazi-looted works (2009). Teammate''s consistency challenge: if dignity justifies an exception for remains and justice one for Nazi loot, what principle excludes a spoil of colonial war?', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333302', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'source'),
  ('4e431870-6a70-488b-b46f-856a60ddf36d', 'a73a5756-8042-4863-9125-8617ea032a8e', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 9), 'the Benin lesson: after Germany returned bronzes to Nigeria in 2022, a 2023 decree vested ownership in the Oba, raising public-access fears, so public display should be written into the transfer. In 2009 Egypt suspended cooperation with the Louvre until it returned five fresco fragments, which France did within weeks. An early, voluntary return buys loans and goodwill; a forced one buys nothing.', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333302', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'example'),
  ('3f8906d9-4efe-4453-a477-e0b7bd383e2f', '409926ce-a2e8-4f11-8c3b-6baa98ffe4ab', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 10), 'the Delhi High Court''s order applies to people acquitted or discharged.', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333303', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'case_fact'),
  ('1d74a5eb-1f24-4584-a4aa-65bdf712871b', 'c2ac09bb-031f-4b60-8f18-34859a8c0cb0', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 10), 'Mill''s harm principle cuts both ways: the information harms the person while serving no one''s safety. Restorative justice (the team noted South Africa''s truth-and-reconciliation model) aims at return to the community, not permanent exclusion.', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333303', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'framework'),
  ('d08baeb3-c1d3-413c-a4da-51e05f33b2e2', '4378c383-ae70-4f21-af8f-925ef7cf8efe', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 10), 'the U.S. Supreme Court''s idea of "practical obscurity" (1989): records once kept in courthouse files were public but hard to find. De-indexing restores that balance; anyone with a real need can still look.', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333303', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'case_fact'),
  ('37d35a08-482f-41b1-bd80-0d4273c38b9d', 'ebcfd940-a327-450f-9613-2db3b5d8112d', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 10), 'our consent principle: information about a private person, posted by someone else without consent, may be removed (revenge porn is the clearest case). Add an age line: content from before 18 deserves extra protection.', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333303', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'case_fact'),
  ('9deb323a-fe5f-4a5e-a7d7-67a93cf46c11', '08dc0988-a3ea-44b4-9d02-85a85dc5af4b', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 10), 'Platner deleted his posts, but voters have a legitimate interest in what a candidate said publicly. Officials get less leeway, and powerful people could otherwise use the right to scrub their records.', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333303', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'case_fact'),
  ('ef6fb3b5-1fc6-4129-8f7e-e3928584f0af', 'dfab4d04-4cd7-4b7a-bbd2-1ef2c54c7b5c', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 10), 'accountability requires a reliable record; Jeremy Waldron''s work on dignity explains why the harm of exposure must be weighed against the public''s need, not ignored.', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333303', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'framework'),
  ('c761681d-5eb1-440b-9dc3-879cf46061a0', '484002db-4289-470c-90e1-937f9f76dc03', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 11), '350,000 deaths a year from cervical cancer; about 4 million girls vaccinated.', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333304', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'case_fact'),
  ('ecee0d80-d763-46b8-939b-a603e878d21c', '5f7bee18-e65f-4765-9c47-61ef4d652ac3', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 11), 'our practice distinguished crime that produced the money from crime separate from it. The foundation''s money wasn''t made through the conduct revealed in the documents.', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333304', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'source'),
  ('3ac56e26-ca3c-462e-bfc3-cfd893063c2a', 'e9a02a2f-deeb-4b3a-874c-0ac8b8479164', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 11), 'restorative alternatives exist: the Epstein victims'' fund compensated survivors directly. Partners can support repair rather than walk away from patients.', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333304', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'example'),
  ('95fd3fb8-6f52-4dc8-834c-696fb1122ccb', '0a0f5aa1-1941-4dc7-8e34-9079fc3a648c', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 11), 'Kant''s humanity formula: using a charity''s beneficiaries as a means to repair one''s image treats them as tools.', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333304', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'framework'),
  ('1c1bf5c7-e047-4677-8d26-54d4bd8f58aa', 'c160b64a-2203-4228-8659-3ad7628f7555', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 11), 'the 2013 email about paying Afghan tribal leaders shows how quickly a vaccination drive''s methods can become a scandal; the CIA''s fake vaccination campaign in Pakistan damaged trust in vaccines for years (verify).', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333304', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'example'),
  ('ee3ef778-5a63-4bb7-9fbd-604a3d7c85da', '4ce93b02-dd06-4c89-9c6d-9e27bb80d135', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 11), 'donor anonymity and transparency rules: an organization can accept funds without naming rights, publish its conditions, and keep decision-making independent.', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333304', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'source'),
  ('b30330fd-6d9d-4a97-bc8a-53e036a5c019', '5e45fe6f-f5fb-41b3-ab78-114af0037839', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 12), 'Mill''s harm principle; Article 19(3) of the International Covenant on Civil and Political Rights, which China signed in 1998, allows limits necessary for public health.', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333301', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'framework'),
  ('645bdbaa-ff94-44c9-aa46-762b5b79ba33', '04ab95bb-5367-4f7b-9d0f-866f181883a0', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 12), '92% of 1.07 billion short-video users consume health content; the U.S. had 2,065 measles cases in 2025.', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333301', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'case_fact'),
  ('5d86a57d-f5fc-4fed-ab71-d99e80f1fe4a', 'c689be79-efd7-45a0-a75a-f8511173795d', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 12), 'C. Thi Nguyen on trust (from our resources): faking expertise exploits a trust we can''t avoid giving. The grammar test separates claims ("X causes Y," "do this to cure Z") from anecdotes ("I tried this") and values ("trust natural remedies").', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333301', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'framework'),
  ('363a4649-3d7e-4ae3-afab-73aa9eb74edd', 'db68d154-92f7-4ece-a6f3-2f2ca60a732d', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 12), 'Mill, *On Liberty*, ch. 2. Semmelweis''s handwashing was rejected in the 1840s; the bacterial cause of ulcers won a 2005 Nobel after doubt; Li Wenliang''s warning was labeled a rumor. Miranda Fricker''s epistemic injustice: credential gates can discount patients'' and traditional communities'' knowledge (the team''s Flonase example).', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333301', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'framework'),
  ('47ae024b-80bd-4984-ac3b-550f92b0fdc1', '5ce52a10-703d-407f-abcc-77471236ff9a', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 12), 'Article 4 makes political orientation a condition of speaking. Facebook''s 2021 reversal shows labels shift in democracies too. Flip test: would you give this power to officials you distrust?', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333301', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'case_fact'),
  ('80511b4d-80a8-48f6-a2c8-dd9added0ef7', 'd2138c2a-8abe-400b-8cf0-6553276c49d7', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 12), 'credential tags let viewers judge; Google already holds "Your Money or Your Life" pages to a higher bar. Licensing fails because credentials don''t guarantee truth (Purdue''s 2007 plea).', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333301', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'source'),
  ('9021c397-3f01-410a-9aeb-4cce87ee679e', '092a984c-e785-4cb5-8ec5-53b55d4fe811', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 13), 'accomplice liability holds people who knowingly encourage a crime responsible alongside the person who commits it. Henry II never ordered Becket''s murder, yet did public penance in 1174.', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333302', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'source'),
  ('2bb1bd2a-d169-4ce9-bc04-4244eb9248da', '23882047-dec8-43cf-80cb-bd26960a395a', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 13), 'Derek Parfit''s "mistakes in moral mathematics" (1984): it''s a mistake to ignore small chances of great harm spread across many people. We blame a drunk driver for the risk they impose even on nights they don''t crash. The speaker controls the curve, not which point on it acts.', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333302', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'framework'),
  ('57a84258-3ec3-40a5-931d-6cd3c59ae6f1', '21250799-92cc-4d35-b512-96368c346d88', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 13), 'Kant''s humanity formula (the team''s lead framework): the speaker treats listeners as tools, betting one will act, and targets as obstacles. Jeremy Waldron''s *The Harm in Hate Speech* (2012): it attacks a group''s assurance of equal standing. Austin''s speech-act theory: labeling a group as vermin is an act of marking them. The 2003 Rwanda media convictions show rhetoric can be a recognized cause of mass violence.', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333302', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'framework'),
  ('b87e59cd-4c22-41ab-9ed5-e712099bbdaa', '24a54b9b-3c85-463f-ace3-ec6a3fe4ecf1', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 13), 'Martin Luther King Jr. paired mass audiences with explicit, repeated commitments to nonviolence. Major speakers have speechwriters and rehearse; "I can''t control how people interpret me" is weak from someone who crafts every line.', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333302', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'example'),
  ('070164b1-e314-41a1-93ce-b5382ec19d77', 'ab96d003-91ab-4dbf-ab1d-aa84f0cf8c87', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 13), '*Counterman v. Colorado* (2023) uses recklessness for true threats; moral responsibility needs no more. Once a speaker learns violence followed their words and continues, it''s foreseeable.', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333302', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'source'),
  ('d142ecb9-99f8-4759-8d45-4ee428115cb7', 'bdd66ecc-02cd-4727-89f4-9bded86e8b9e', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 13), 'Brandeis in *Whitney*: if there''s time to answer falsehood through discussion, the remedy is more speech. Protection cuts both ways: *Whitney* convicted a left-wing activist; *Brandenburg* protected a Klan leader. Civil-rights leaders were routinely accused of stirring up violence.', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333302', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'source'),
  ('71c4b253-058c-45df-9441-9f049a120460', '68bc79e4-5082-44f0-b511-d553790b95a3', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 14), 'sycophancy, the tendency to tell users what they want to hear, is a known design result, not an accident. The team rejected the "it''s just a knife" analogy for this reason: a knife doesn''t answer back.', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333303', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'source'),
  ('26903890-0ce8-46b3-94ad-7c904b2fa7b6', '4a80fe64-7c91-4866-bcd6-46021d24d3a0', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 14), 'the bot''s response to "come home" was generated for this user, in character, in an ongoing relationship. A book like *The Catcher in the Rye* says the same words to every reader.', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333303', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'case_fact'),
  ('29bd3ece-2532-4e2a-b748-0b7abb5e43d9', 'dd2783d8-892b-4a82-9d3a-9e662eef5f62', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 14), 'the study of 29 chatbots found none adequate in responding to suicide risk; vulnerable teens using companion bots is predictable.', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333303', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'case_fact'),
  ('6b500465-c22f-4314-b95c-febe821b15f4', 'f8a2f22b-20b9-49a9-adaf-fbd894f6ebc7', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 14), 'a homework bot and a romantic companion bot need different safeguards. The team''s permissible-versus-impermissible-uses list: where uses conflict, prohibited uses override permitted ones.', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333303', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'source'),
  ('6d3ded1d-a1ee-4a8b-9fae-006dea04eea0', 'e2d304ca-4d0f-4fab-a349-37a6feb8c445', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 14), 'the bot already discouraged suicide when it was mentioned directly, so detection exists; the gap was indirect language. Our team''s minimum: end the chat and give resources. Contacting police is too far for a default.', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333303', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'case_fact'),
  ('7ddc1266-5740-470b-8830-8a9e627e9c7d', 'a61345db-3506-465a-b7c8-660d5b4383fc', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 14), 'soft paternalism: intervene where a choice isn''t fully informed or voluntary (minors, people in crisis), not across the board. Some people benefit from AI companionship, such as lonely adults or people practicing conversation.', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333303', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'framework'),
  ('cfd2bf6e-3784-4c85-b9be-71903ff3667a', '9f87d6a2-3a62-4cc9-a5e7-d3e13ee10d87', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 15), 'Peter Singer''s equal consideration of interests: a being''s pain counts whoever''s it is. Our team: sentience is sufficient for moral worth, though not necessary.', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333304', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'framework'),
  ('cbc22be5-7115-44c8-a91a-f61ed6e68ae8', '6c54f4da-861e-40a9-8aff-6a25e23e0a9e', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 15), 'Birch et al. (2020) on assessing sentience; Germany, New Zealand, Denmark, Spain and the UK recognize it in law.', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333304', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'case_fact'),
  ('59ab0f1a-5943-404e-b94c-bd2b0fd42b98', '2c7f5f1d-96f9-4db0-b763-f6e0dfdd77ce', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 15), 'Regan''s car, dog and stray: under property law the harm to a dog is a harm to its owner, so a stray has no protection at all.', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333304', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'example'),
  ('533e0efe-8433-4857-a2ad-50decc7cff29', 'dfd8814a-f13f-44d7-a480-62e49bdb9373', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 15), '"ought implies can": morality can''t demand instant abolition of all animal use. Our team''s principle: harm only if necessary and minimal, with a transition over time.', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333304', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'framework'),
  ('44b64350-3150-44c7-870c-421193bf3de0', '94f071bb-5b30-4b5b-9e9b-15f563dd2917', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 15), 'Christopher Stone''s "Should Trees Have Standing?" (1972) argued that natural objects could have legal guardians; the "sentient property" middle position works the same way.', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333304', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'example'),
  ('615e6169-60cf-4c73-a0ad-130508818b9b', '6ca78697-5239-400f-89c4-8737d10f312a', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 15), 'the suffering is severe and mostly unnecessary for human survival. Even Kant, who denied animals direct moral status, held that cruelty to animals damages our humanity toward people.', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333304', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'framework')
insert into counterclaims (id, team_id, case_id, text, concede, distinguish, rebut, citation_ids, created_at, created_by, updated_at, claim_id) values
  ('3ebbf4aa-38a1-4f00-801e-03ffa51c1d03', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 1), 'AI is a neutral tool like Excel, refusing it costs lives, and only the law, not a company, should bind the military.', '(3) that''s why Claim 2 puts the limits in law.', '(2) we accept decision support; the objection is to delegating the kill decision.', 'a system that ranks targets embeds choices about training data, thresholds and acceptable error. Excel doesn''t choose who lives.', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333301', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', '016342ef-9507-425e-b013-79c440a1a8fc'),
  ('87821e1f-4822-460e-a86e-aff32d4d5f98', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 1), 'If AI is proven more accurate, refusing it is itself unethical.', 'See response.', 'See response.', '"Proven" accuracy in tests isn''t accuracy in the fog of war, where adversaries spoof data. And even perfect accuracy leaves the responsibility gap (S1) and the lower threshold for war (S3).', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333301', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'b239d8fc-64e8-4ba9-aa93-b9c6fcec29ac'),
  ('d290e64d-0578-48ca-a8b5-2967c62f74a2', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 3), 'Memorials abroad inflame nationalism, damage today''s relations, and ignore that Japan has apologized.', '(2) that''s why S3 of Claim 1 matters.', '(3) honoring victims in your own city isn''t foreign policy.', 'apologies that survivors reject don''t close the question, and using diplomatic ties to pressure a city to remove a memorial treats memory as a bargaining chip.', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333302', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'd4d11d10-23d6-4307-bae4-091c8fc237e4'),
  ('3d17f332-e4e9-407d-b253-556387717d2f', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 3), 'Who are Americans to judge another culture''s way of handling its past?', 'See response.', 'See response.', 'We apply the same test to ourselves (Claim 2), which is the difference between universal principle and cultural imperialism.', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333302', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', '2b8fd8f4-0bfc-4271-bf2a-45ab4847982b'),
  ('26f4fcec-3e0f-400f-893e-91ea2085d535', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 4), 'Pursuing beauty is rational and even prudent, because attractiveness brings real advantages.', 'the advantages are real. **Distinguish** prudence from duty (Claim 1, S3). **Rebut** the conclusion: the right response to unjust advantages is to reduce the bias in institutions, not to demand that everyone chase the ideal.', 'prudence from duty (Claim 1, S3). **Rebut** the conclusion: the right response to unjust advantages is to reduce the bias in institutions, not to demand that everyone chase the ideal.', 'the right response to unjust advantages is to reduce the bias in institutions, not to demand that everyone chase the ideal.', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333303', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', '00913420-8750-4ff3-a5c9-1a664aa09787'),
  ('e8c327be-3da4-45e4-b4cf-3b1b2db9f76e', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 4), 'Criticizing men''s looksmaxxing is a double standard; women have done this openly for decades.', 'the double standard in the critics, as the case notes. Our claims apply equally to all genders: no one has a duty to be beautiful, and no one should be sold extreme practices as a minor.', 'See response.', 'Concede the double standard in the critics, as the case notes. Our claims apply equally to all genders: no one has a duty to be beautiful, and no one should be sold extreme practices as a minor.', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333303', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'b9834a6a-ddcc-4ec1-aca6-0aba625e0eda'),
  ('703fd1f7-11ae-46b7-838e-0a1b3403dadd', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 5), 'Prediction markets are the most accurate forecasting tool, and accurate information saves lives, even about war.', '(3) the same accuracy is possible without money on death; forecasting tournaments like the Good Judgment Project do it without betting on lives (verify before citing).', '** in war markets, the "information" is often leaked secrets, which is the harm', 'the same accuracy is possible without money on death; forecasting tournaments like the Good Judgment Project do it without betting on lives (verify before citing).', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333304', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', '801067f8-89a5-4288-82fa-add18c826dcb'),
  ('aebee715-3659-4faf-9452-5e900a8fd9ea', '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333', (select id from cases where number = 5), 'It''s just like the stock market; you''re betting on defense stocks when war comes.', 'See response.', '** stocks fund companies and have a productive purpose; a contract on whether a leader is killed exists only to bet on the event', 'Distinguish: stocks fund companies and have a productive purpose; a contract on whether a leader is killed exists only to bet on the event. Insider trading is also illegal in stocks for the same reason we object here.', '{}'::uuid[], '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333304', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', '33f8280b-88c9-46ee-962b-36ab06e7fe50'),
